{
  "folder": "slrw8J4BHT24qLkW",
  "name": "地精（舊版）（自由加點）Goblin (GGR)",
  "type": "race",
  "img": "icons/weapons/clubs/club-banded-brown.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div><table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">屬性值提升</strong></span></p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">體型</strong></span></p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">速度</strong></span></p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">敏捷</span> +2; <span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">體質</span> +1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">小體型</span></p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">30尺</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Age\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">年齡:</strong>地精在8歲時成年，他們顯然衰老得比人類要快，儘管很少有地精能活到老，他們中最小心謹慎的也能活過60歲。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">陣營:</strong>拉尼卡的地精多數是混亂陣營，而善良還是邪惡並沒有特別的傾向。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">體型:</strong>地精大約3到4尺高，體重40到80磅，你是小體型。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">速度:</strong>你的基礎步行速度爲30尺。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">黑暗視覺：</strong>在昏暗環境下，你可以看清你周圍60英尺內的區域如同處於明亮光照下；在黑暗環境下，你可以視爲微光光照。你在黑暗中無法分辨顏色，只能看到灰色的畫面。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">小型生物的怒火：</strong>當你對比你大型的生物使用攻擊或魔法，並造成傷害時，你可以對它造成額外傷害。這個額外傷害等於你的等級。該特性在你完成一次短休或長休前無法再次使用。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">敏捷逃脫：</strong>地精可在自己的回合，以一個附贈動作進行撤離（Disengage）或者躲藏（Hide）動作。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">語言：</strong>你可以說、讀及寫通用語和地精語。在拉尼卡，地精語是一門過分簡化的語言，詞彙量極其有限並且語法支離破碎，不適合用於高雅的交談中。</span></p></div></div><hr class=\"hr-1\" /><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">無論是在恐懼中流淚，在瘋狂的笑聲中咯咯地笑，還是在憤怒中咆哮，地精都是可憐的、無關緊要的——至少在拉尼卡的其他大多數人眼裏是這樣。然而，在他們自己的腦子裏，他們滿足於潛伏在陰影中，直到他們完全進入自己的內心並獲得他們認爲應得的認可。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" />他們有資格獲得一些榮譽，因爲他們的堅韌，敏捷，狡猾的創造力，和該死的運氣，所有這些使他們能夠超越那些比他們更大，更強的生物，在這個世界上生存下來。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" /><strong style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">短小精悍</strong><br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" />地精約有3英尺高，渾身覆蓋着疣綠色的皮膚，地精有着巨大的鼻子和耳朵。它們瘦弱的身體出奇地強壯，嘴裏滿是鋒利的彎曲的牙齒。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" />大多數地精都是禿頂的，無論是遺傳還是選擇，但也有少數地精誇耀自己紅色或黑色的頭髮。它們的胳膊和腿與它們的小身體成比例地伸長，它們的手指和腳趾也長而細。許多地精喜歡裸露腳趾便於攀爬。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" /><strong style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">不羈情感</strong><br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" />作爲有原始衝動的生物，地精在一些公會中發現了自己的價值，尤其是伊捷聯盟（他們通常作爲研究人員的服務員），古魯部族（在部落和文明地區之間形成了倒黴的緩衝營地），拉鐸司宗派（把他們對爆炸的熱愛用到了正確的地方）.偶爾還有波洛斯（如果他們發現自己內心有紀律和勇氣，或者發現自己無法抵擋波洛斯人武器和裝甲的光芒）。許多地精是無公會的，這讓他們淪爲了街頭幫派的成員。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" />有時，受到狂野情緒波動的驅使，地精傾向於毀滅，這種毀滅可以採取一種好玩的形式，但通常不是。有些地精笨手笨腳的，其他地精喜歡把這些笨蛋給點天燈，同時還有一羣地精徹底把事情搞砸。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" />地精有一種不可理喻的幽默感，通常通過有害的惡作劇來表達。他們中的惡人在別人的不幸中找到樂趣，每當他們被逗樂時，往往會發出狂笑。他們可以表現出明顯的隨機性，有時只是爲了迷惑別人。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" /><strong style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">地精的姓名</strong><br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" />地精鍾愛某種特定的聲音，地精的名字往往會重複這些聲音，形成聽起來像廢話的詞語。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" /><strong style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">地精名:</strong>Azzinax, Babolax, Blixanix, Crixizix, Dazzaz, Estrix, Finizix, Juzba, Kaluzax, Lyzaxa, Mizzix, Myznar, Nixispix, Paxizaz, Ravixiz, Stixil,Sunnix, Tozinox, Uxivozi, Vazozav, Wexiny, Zizzix</span></p><p></p></div></div></div><div><table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Ability Scores</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Size</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Speed</p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Dexterity +2; Constitution +1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Small</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>30 ft.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Age\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Age.</span> Goblins reach adulthood around age 8. They age noticeably faster than humans, and though few goblins live to old age, the most cautious rarely live longer than 60 years.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Size\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Size.</span> Goblins are between 3 and 4 feet tall and weigh between 40 and 80 pounds. Your size is Small.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Darkvision\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Darkvision.</span> You can see in dim light within 60 feet of you as if it were bright light, and in darkness as if it were dim light. You can't discern color in darkness, only shades of gray.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Fury of the Small\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Fury of the Small.</span> When you damage a creature with an attack or a spell and the creature's size is larger than yours, you can cause the attack or spell to deal extra damage to the creature. The extra damage equals your level. Once you use this trait, you can't use it again until you finish a short or long rest.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Nimble Escape\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Nimble Escape.</span> You can take the @action[Disengage] or @action[Hide] action as a bonus action on each of your turns.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Languages\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Languages.</span> You can speak, read, and write Common and Goblin. In Ravnica, Goblin is a simplistic language with a limited vocabulary and fluid rules of grammar, unsuited for any sophisticated conversation.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Alignment\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Alignment.</span> Goblins are typically neutral evil, as they care only for their own needs. A few goblins might tend toward good or neutrality, but only rarely.</p></div></div><hr class=\"hr-1\" /><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p>Whether sniveling in fear, cackling with mad laughter, or snarling in a fury, goblins are wretched and inconsequential—at least in the eyes of most of Ravnica's other folk. In their own minds, though, they are content to lurk in the shadows only until they fully come into their own and receive the recognition they believe they deserve. They are entitled to some credit for their tenacity, agility, crafty ingenuity, and dumb luck, all of which has enabled them to survive in a world overrun with creatures larger and more powerful than they are.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Small and Wiry\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Small and Wiry.</span> Standing around 3 feet tall and covered in warty green or red skin, goblins have huge noses and ears. Their wiry bodies are surprisingly strong, and their mouths are full of sharp, crooked teeth.</p><p>Most goblins are bald, either by heredity or by choice, but a few boast shocks of red or black hair. Their arms and legs are elongated in proportion to their small bodies, and their fingers and toes are also long and slender. Many goblins prefer to go unshod to leave their toes exposed for climbing.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Unfettered Emotion\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Unfettered Emotion.</span> Creatures of raw impulse, goblins are found among guilds that value that quality, particularly the Izzet (where they typically serve as attendants for researchers), the Gruul (in camps that form hapless buffers between the clans and civilized regions), the Rakdos (putting their love of explosions to good use), and occasionally the Boros (if they discover a well of discipline and courage within themselves, or find themselves unable to resist the shininess of Boros weapons and armor). Many goblins are guildless and make their way as members of street gangs.</p><p>Sometimes driven by wild mood swings, goblins have an inclination toward destruction, which can take a playful form but is often anything but. Some goblins clobber things, others like to light them on fire, and many love to blow things up.</p><p>Goblins have an outrageous sense of humor, usually expressed through mischievous pranks. The malicious among them find pleasure in the misfortune of others and tend to cackle maniacally whenever they're amused. They can act with apparent randomness, sometimes just to confuse and befuddle others.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Goblin Names\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Goblin Names.</span> The Goblin language is fond of certain sounds, and goblin names tend to repeat those sounds to form what can sound like nonsense words. A goblin's name gives no indication of gender.</p><ul class=\"rd__list rd__list-hang-notitle\"><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Goblin Names:\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Goblin Names:</span> Azzinax, Babolax, Blixanix, Crixizix, Dazzaz, Estrix, Finizix, Juzba, Kaluzax, Lyzaxa, Mizzix, Myznar, Nixispix, Paxizaz, Ravixiz, Stixil, Sunnix, Tozinox, Uxivozi, Vazozav, Wexiny, Zizzix</p></li></ul></div></div></div></div>",
